                "text": "**Analyzing Shape Relationships**\n\nI'm currently focused on identifying patterns between input shapes and their selected outputs. Specifically, I'm examining how shape dimensions like width, height, and area relate to the choice of the output shape. I've begun reviewing the relationship between area size and selection choice using the examples provided. I'm noting specific characteristics of shapes.\n\n\n**Identifying the Minimum Area**\n\nI've made a breakthrough! It seems the system selects the solid rectangle with the *minimum* area from the available options. I've confirmed this pattern across multiple examples, including those where non-rectangles were present. I'm now cross-referencing and confirming this hypothesis.\n\n\n",
